  "title": "How schedulr works",
  "description": "A SchedulingProblem holds activities, resources, participants, calendars, rules and goals. compile validates it and builds a unifier constraint model; invalid input comes back as one CompileError with every message. solve constructs a feasible schedule first and optimizes it with the remaining time budget. A feasible result is a Solution with the assignments and the score of every rule; without one, explain returns the conflicts, named after your resources, participants and activities.",
